CM_ SG_ 1040 REL_SPEED "Range rate, negative = closing. Scale 0.015625 m/s (1/64), measured 2026-10-09: on bus 1 d(LONG_DIST)/dt = 2.01-2.03 x the old 1/128 decode on routes 113 and 120 (A group; B 2.00-2.01 by median ratio), and a stationary object read -0.50 x vEgo at 1/128. The 1/128 scale this file carried until then halved every radar vRel. 14-bit signed: byte 4 bits 7:6 are never set. Same on all 13 track messages.";
CM_ SG_ 1041 REL_SPEED "Range rate, negative = closing, 0.015625 m/s: see 1040 REL_SPEED.";
