CM_ SG_ 1040 LONG_DIST "Range, 0.0078125 m (1/128), 0-255.98 m. Raw 0x7FFF (255.9921875) is an EMPTY slot: the only empty pattern in 9.9 M logged frames, and real returns reach 255.8 m, so the empty test is raw == 0x7FFF, not a range limit (radar_interface.py tested LONG_DIST < 255 until 2026-10-24). Same on all 13 track messages.";
CM_ SG_ 1041 LONG_DIST "Range, 1/128 m; raw 0x7FFF is an empty slot: see 1040 LONG_DIST.";
CM_ SG_ 1042 LONG_DIST "Range, 1/128 m; raw 0x7FFF is an empty slot: see 1040 LONG_DIST.";
