CM_ SG_ 1040 NEW_TRACK "1 = the radar has put a new object in this slot. Set on two frames in a row, the second frame is another new object 92% of the time (1,467 repeats on 6 routes, 2026-10-24) and the same object otherwise; radar_interface.py gives a new trackId on a rising edge, or on a held 1 whose frame does not continue the slot's object. Same on all 13 track messages.";
CM_ SG_ 1041 NEW_TRACK "1 = a new object in this slot: see 1040 NEW_TRACK.";
CM_ SG_ 1042 NEW_TRACK "1 = a new object in this slot: see 1040 NEW_TRACK.";
