CM_ SG_ 1040 COASTING "1 = the radar extrapolated this track this cycle instead of measuring it (RadarPoint.measured = 0). When set, REL_SPEED repeats the previous frame 89.6% of the time (33.6% when clear) and the range follows a constant-speed prediction to 0.04 m (0.10 m when clear). Set on 36-38% of stationary-clutter frames and 0.3% of camera-confirmed lead frames. Named FLAG_B22 until 2026-10-24. Same on all 13 track messages.";
CM_ SG_ 1041 COASTING "1 = extrapolated, not measured, this cycle: see 1040 COASTING.";
